  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Payment of Reintegration Cash Support to Returnees from Sweden (2024)</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project contributes to the sustainable reintegration of around 440 returnees from Sweden through the provision of reintegration cash support (re-establishment support). Activities will be implemented with a view to ensure that the cash assistance is paid to the beneficiaries upon arrival to the country of origin and in line with the Swedish Migration Agency&apos;s work to enhancing the voluntary return and reintegration support for returnees from Sweden. The project will offer pre-departure assistance including counselling through a helpline, on the payment procedure of the reintegration cash support in countries of origin, as well as possible distribution of information materials in different languages. Systematic programme and beneficiary monitoring will be carried out throughout the project duration.</narrative>
  </description>
